<title>JAPAN: Oriental Yeast -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Oriental Yeast -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.52		vs	   26.13</p>
<p> Operating	  100    million    vs	  525    million</p>
<p> Current	    147    million    vs	  561    million</p>
<p> Net		  158    million    vs	  254    million</p>
